members. Try a shorter keyword.</div></div>\n<div class=\"api-row\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablestreamsources\"><div class=\"api-col left\"></div><div class=\"api-col middle\" style=\"color:#AAA\">method</div><div class=\"api-col right\"><a class=\"trigger\" href=\"#ivideostreammanager_getavailablestreamsources_inline\">getAvailableStreamSources</a></div></div><div class=\"inline-doc ifm-method-doc\" id=\"ivideostreammanager_getavailablestreamsources_inline\" <blockquote=\"\" data-ifm-title=\"1\" data-ifm-card=\"1\"><div class=\"ifm-method-title-row\"><span class=\"ifm-type-badge\">method</span><h3>getAvailableStreamSources</h3></div>\n\n\n<figure class=\"highlight java ifm-signature-figure\" data-jv-colored=\"1\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"jv-annotation\">@Nullable</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><wbr><span class=\"jv-type\">List</span><wbr><span class=\"jv-punct\">&lt;</span><span class=\"jv-type\">StreamSource</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"jv-method\">getAvailableStreamSources</span><span class=\"params\"><span class=\"jv-punct\">(</span><span class=\"jv-punct\">)</span></span></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n<table class=\"table-supportedby\" style=\"display: none;\"><tbody><tr valign=\"top\"><td width=\"15%\"><font color=\"#999\"><i>Package:</i></font></td><td width=\"85%\"><font color=\"#999\">dji.v5.manager.interfaces</font></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><font color=\"#666\">Get a list of available<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager_StreamSource.html#ivideostreammanager_streamsource\">StreamSource</a></code>. After getting all video stream sources, you can call<code><a href=\"IVideoStreamManager.html#ivideostreammanager_getavailablevideochannels\">getAvailableVideoChannels</a></code>to get available video channel and add the video source in.</font></p><font color=\"#666\">\n<h3 class=\"ifm-plain-heading\">Return</h3>\n<table class=\"ifm-params-ta